`sample.canvas` in this directory is copied byte-identically from the JSON Canvas
specification repository (https://github.com/obsidianmd/jsoncanvas) and is used
as a conformance fixture: it is the sample the spec authors publish, so parsing
and re-emitting it unchanged is the most direct check that our reader and writer
agree with the format's own reference document.

It is MIT-licensed, and MIT requires that the copyright and permission notice
travel with copies. The notice, verbatim:

